          "q": "Is the INR 1.25 lakh exemption available on foreign ETF gains?",
          "a": "<p>No. The exemption applies to listed Indian equity and equity-oriented funds that pay securities transaction tax. Foreign ETF and UCITS gains are taxed under the ordinary long-term and short-term rules, so the whole gain is taxable once the 12.5% or slab rate is applied.</p>"
